  'How much have you spend':'How much have you spent?',
  'I red book':'I read a book',
  'Beard man':'A bearded man',
  'Women don’t like beard man':'Women don’t like bearded men',
  'I will absolutely get married with her':'I will definitely marry her',
  'My aunt is married with my uncle':'My aunt is married to my uncle',
  'There are people in bank':'There are people in the bank',
  'I work in bank':'I work in a bank',
  'I am working in bank':'I am working in a bank',
  'I will work in bank':'I will work in a bank',
  'I am gonna work in bank':'I am going to work in a bank',
