  'She worked in bank':'She worked in a bank',
  'How much money is there in bank':'How much money is there in the bank?',
  'I have worked in bank for a long time':'I have worked in a bank for a long time',
  'I have been working in bank for 5 years':'I have been working in a bank for five years',
  'There are beautiful nurses in hospital':'There are nurses in the hospital',
